#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, CornerBarrierLabel)
#: main.ui:270
#, kde-format
msgid "&Corner barrier:"
msgstr "Barijera u &uglovima:"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_CornerBarrier)
#: main.ui:280
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Here you can enable or disable the virtual corner barrier between screens. "
"The barrier prevents the pointer from moving to another screen when it is "
"already touching a screen corner. This makes it easier to trigger user "
"interface elements like maximized windows' close buttons when using multiple "
"screens."
msgstr ""
"Ovde možete uključiti ili isključiti virtuelnu barijeru u uglovima između "
"ekrana. Barijera sprečava da pokazivač pređe na drugi ekran kada već "
"dodiruje ugao ekrana. Tako je lakše okinuti elemente korisničkog sučelja, "
"kao što su dugmad za zatvaranje maksimizovanih prozora, kada koristite više "
"ekrana."

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_CornerBarrier)
#: main.ui:283
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid "Prevents the pointer from crossing at screen corners."
msgstr "Sprečava prelazak pokazivača u uglovima ekrana."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, EdgeBarrierLabel)
#: main.ui:290
#, kde-format
msgid "&Edge barrier:"
msgstr "Barijera na &ivicama:"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QSpinBox, kcfg_EdgeBarrier)
#: main.ui:300
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Here you can set size of the edge barrier between different screens. The "
"barrier adds additional distance you have to move your pointer before it "
"crosses the edge onto the other screen. This makes it easier to access user "
"interface elements like Plasma Panels that are located on an edge between "
"screens."
msgstr ""
"Ovde možete zadati veličinu barijere na ivicama između različitih ekrana. "
"Barijera dodaje rastojanje koje pokazivač mora da pređe pre nego što pređe "
"ivicu na drugi ekran. Tako je lakše pristupiti elementima korisničkog "
"sučelja, kao što su plasma paneli, koji se nalaze na ivici između ekrana."

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QSpinBox, kcfg_EdgeBarrier)
#: main.ui:303
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid "Additional distance the pointer needs to travel to cross screen edges."
msgstr ""
"Dodatno rastojanje koje pokazivač mora da pređe da bi prešao ivice ekrana."

#. i18n: ectx: property (specialValueText), widget (QSpinBox, kcfg_EdgeBarrier)
#: main.ui:306
#, kde-format
msgid "None"
msgstr "nikakva"

#. i18n: ectx: property (suffix), widget (QSpinBox, kcfg_EdgeBarrier)
#: main.ui:309
#, kde-format
msgid " px"
msgstr " piks."

